{"title":"데뷔를 피하는 방법","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=j7d8M/hAd4Y0N14w/xNgOLrwR4HtchFjQnjvT8K&filename=th3","synopsis":"한국예고 실용무용과 졸업생, 하현.\nPD 삼촌의 간곡한 요청으로\n아이돌 오디션 프로그램 <서바이벌 ID>의\n대타로 참여하게 되었다.\n\n본래의 계획대로라면\n\"통편집\" \"투명인간\" \"광탈\"의 엔딩을 맞이해야 하지만,\n팬들의 도움(?)으로 매 스테이지마다 살아남게 되는데…\n\n'삼촌, 저 하차하고 싶어요… ㅠㅠ'\n\n한때 몸이 부서져라 춤을 사랑했었으나\n그 꿈 모두 버린 채 살아가던 하현.\n포기하니까 자꾸만 데뷔가 눈앞으로 다가오는 현실 대체 무엇?\n\n\"선배, 저 선배 춤 좋아해요.\"\n\n게다가 하현의 과거를 알고 있는 참가자 '지구'는\n대체 어디서 온 거람?!\n(이름이… '지구'라고? 화성 옆에 그 지구 말하는 건가?)","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-09-25","rank":53,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-26","rank":79,"change":{"type":"down","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-09-27","rank":94,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-09-28","rank":148,"change":{"type":"down","amount":54}},{"date":"2026-10-05","rank":254,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-14","rank":287,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-15","rank":253,"change":{"type":"up","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-10-16","rank":268,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-10-17","rank":250,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-09-25","rank":175,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-26","rank":110,"change":{"type":"up","amount":65}},{"date":"2026-09-27","rank":84,"change":{"type":"up","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-09-28","rank":77,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-09-29","rank":81,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-09-30","rank":82,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-10-01","rank":83,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-10-02","rank":162,"change":{"type":"down","amount":79}},{"date":"2026-10-03","rank":235,"change":{"type":"down","amount":73}}],"monthly":[{"date":"2026-09-26","rank":282,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-27","rank":238,"change":{"type":"up","amount":44}},{"date":